-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Models downloaded at runtime
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Lalela downloads speech and language models the first time you use a feature
that needs them. They are not part of this repository and each is governed by
its own licence, shown by its publisher:

  - Whisper ggml models (Hugging Face: ggerganov/whisper.cpp), MIT License
  - pyannote segmentation 3.0 (ONNX export by the sherpa-onnx project), MIT License
  - NVIDIA NeMo TitaNet speaker embedding (ONNX export by the sherpa-onnx project)
  - On-device language models offered in Settings → AI models, each under the
    licence published with that model
